## Failback Procedure

Restoring original primary for failover group `{{ fg_name }}`.

### Steps
1. Resume replication on original source (now secondary)
2. Trigger refresh to sync drill changes back
3. Wait for refresh to complete
4. Suspend replication on original
5. Promote original back to primary
{%- if enable_redirect == 'Yes' %}
6. Redirect client connection back to original
{%- endif %}
7. Resume scheduled replication on target
